{
  "id": "ACT.15",
  "number": "15",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Acts 15",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.12.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 12.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Some men came from Judea to Antioch and started teaching the believers, “You cannot be saved unless you are circumcised as the Law of Moses requires.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paul and Barnabas got into a fierce argument with them about this, so it was decided that Paul and Barnabas and some of the others in Antioch should go to Jerusalem and see the apostles and elders about this matter.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They were sent on their way by the church; and as they went through Phoenicia and Samaria, they reported how the Gentiles had turned to God; this news brought great joy to all the believers. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When they arrived in Jerusalem, they were welcomed by the church, the apostles, and the elders, to whom they told all that God had done through them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But some of the believers who belonged to the party of the Pharisees stood up and said, “The Gentiles must be circumcised and told to obey the Law of Moses.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The apostles and the elders met together to consider this question. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.10.1+ACT.10.2+ACT.10.3+ACT.10.4+ACT.10.5+ACT.10.6+ACT.10.7+ACT.10.8+ACT.10.9+ACT.10.10+ACT.10.11+ACT.10.12+ACT.10.13+ACT.10.14+ACT.10.15+ACT.10.16+ACT.10.17+ACT.10.18+ACT.10.19+ACT.10.20+ACT.10.21+ACT.10.22+ACT.10.23+ACT.10.24+ACT.10.25+ACT.10.26+ACT.10.27+ACT.10.28+ACT.10.29+ACT.10.30+ACT.10.31+ACT.10.32+ACT.10.33+ACT.10.34+ACT.10.35+ACT.10.36+ACT.10.37+ACT.10.38+ACT.10.39+ACT.10.40+ACT.10.41+ACT.10.42+ACT.10.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 10.1–43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After a long debate Peter stood up and said, “My brothers and sisters, you know that a long time ago God chose me from among you to preach the Good News to the Gentiles, so that they could hear and believe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 2.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.10.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10.44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And God, who knows the thoughts of everyone, showed his approval of the Gentiles by giving the Holy Spirit to them, just as he had to us. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He made no difference between us and them; he forgave their sins because they believed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So then, why do you now want to put God to the test by laying a load on the backs of the believers which neither our ancestors nor we ourselves were able to carry? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No! We believe and are saved by the grace of the Lord Jesus, just as they are.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The whole group was silent as they heard Barnabas and Paul report all the miracles and wonders that God had performed through them among the Gentiles. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When they had finished speaking, James spoke up: “Listen to me, my brothers and sisters! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simon has just explained how God first showed his care for the Gentiles by taking from among them a people to belong to him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The words of the prophets agree completely with this. As the scripture says:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“It is my opinion,” James went on, “that we should not trouble the Gentiles who are turning to God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.15+EXO.34.16+EXO.34.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 34.15–17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.17.10+LEV.17.11+LEV.17.12+LEV.17.13+LEV.17.14+LEV.17.15+LEV.17.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 17.10–16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.6+LEV.18.7+LEV.18.8+LEV.18.9+LEV.18.10+LEV.18.11+LEV.18.12+LEV.18.13+LEV.18.14+LEV.18.15+LEV.18.16+LEV.18.17+LEV.18.18+LEV.18.19+LEV.18.20+LEV.18.21+LEV.18.22+LEV.18.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "18.6–23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Instead, we should write a letter telling them not to eat any food that is ritually unclean because it has been offered to idols; to keep themselves from sexual immorality; and not to eat any animal that has been strangled, or any blood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the Law of Moses has been read for a very long time in the synagogues every Sabbath, and his words are preached in every town.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the apostles and the elders, together with the whole church, decided to choose some men from the group and send them to Antioch with Paul and Barnabas. They chose two men who were highly respected by the believers, Judas, called Barsabbas, and Silas, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and they sent the following letter by them:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The messengers were sent off and went to Antioch, where they gathered the whole group of believers and gave them the letter. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the people read it, they were filled with joy by the message of encouragement. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Judas and Silas, who were themselves prophets, spoke a long time with them, giving them courage and strength. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After spending some time there, they were sent off in peace by the believers and went back to those who had sent them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15.33",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Some manuscripts add verse 34:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "But Silas decided to stay there.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
